    question: "Can I get an AirTalk Wireless tablet with Medicaid?",
    answer:
      "Medicaid may be a Lifeline eligibility path, but tablet availability is still provider-dependent. AirTalk Wireless device options can vary by state, ZIP code, stock, plan terms, shipping, and application review.",
  },
