      "Use AirTalk Wireless official account or status tools, or contact AirTalk directly for application updates, order status, tracking, shipping, activation, SIM issues, or device support. FreeTablet.click cannot access or update your AirTalk order.",
  },
  {
    question: "Is AirTalk Wireless legit?",
